📝 Simple Grading System

A beginner-friendly Python program that takes a student's marks and assigns a grade based on the given marks range.

The program also validates marks, allows the user to check multiple students, and provides a q option to quit.

📌 Features
📝 Accepts marks from the user
📊 Assigns grades based on marks
✅ Validates marks between 0 and 100
❌ Displays an invalid-marks message for values outside the valid range
🔄 Allows multiple students to be checked
🚪 Allows the user to quit by entering q or Q


🧠 Concepts Used

This project helped me practice:

