f-strings
Range checking
Basic input validation
📊 Grading System

The program uses the following grading rules:

Marks	Grade
90 – 100	A+
80 – 89	A
70 – 79	B
60 – 69	C
40 – 59	D
0 – 39	Fail
< 0 or > 100	Invalid Marks


⚙️ How It Works

The program follows these steps:

Displays the Simple Grading System heading.
Asks the user to enter their marks.
The user can enter q or Q to quit.
Converts the marks into an integer using int().
Checks whether the marks are within the valid range.
Uses if-elif-else to determine the grade.
Displays the result.
Returns to the beginning so another student's marks can be entered.
Continues until the user chooses to quit.


